<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74447" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀπίζομαι</span></b> , 
			Lacon.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀπίδδομαι</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			5(1).919
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i> only pres. and impf.
		<i><span class="en">
			2
		</span></i> and 3sg. : later also
		part. (v. infr.), and aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠπίσατο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					2.618
				</span></i>
			: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄπις</span>):—<i>regard
				with awe and dread,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Διὸς δ᾽ ὠπίζετο μῆνιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					14.283
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ὅ γ᾽ ὀπίζετο μῆνιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Sc.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὸν θυμὸν ὀπίζομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					13.148
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μητρὸς . . ὠπίζετ᾽ ἐφετμήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.216
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμὲ δ᾽ οὐδὲν ὀπίζεο νόσφιν ἐόντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					22.332
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Merc.</u>
				382
			</span></i> : abs. in part., <i>feel awe</i> or
				<i>reverence,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.86
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>I.</u>
				3.5
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάρις ὀπιζομένα</span>”
				<i>filled with reverence,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>P.</u>
					2.17
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> after <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, <i>care for,</i> c. gen. pers., <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				734
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				1148
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.181
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Man.
				6.218
			</span></i> :—so later in 
				Act.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σώματος . . ὀπίζων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>App.Anth.</u>
					3.143
				</span></i>
			.—
				Ep.
			 and Lyr. Verb, never in Trag.</div>
